WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.445
A graph edit network attaches to a standard GNN
backbone and predicts a script of edits: insert,

00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:10.116
delete or replace a node, or insert or delete an edge.

00:00:10.196 --> 00:00:14.262
Applying them in sequence maps the current graph to
the next.

00:00:14.342 --> 00:00:19.156
Training uses reference mappings from
graph-edit-distance approximators,

00:00:19.236 --> 00:00:22.419
with two loss variants, hinge and cross-entropy,

00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:25.070
and edge-filtering for citation graphs.
